WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:01.625
- I’m off to find another disgruntled vet.

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:04.791
I left detailed instructions, but make sure you protect the Lombardi Trophy!

00:00:04.791 --> 00:00:05.416
- Yeah, yeah.
- Of course!

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:08.125
- You know me: Get me started early, or I'll throw a lil fit!

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:09.250
LET’S PARTY.

00:00:10.416 --> 00:00:11.250
[Groaning]

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.375
The only person supporting us is YG again.

00:00:13.375 --> 00:00:17.250
- So we had a three-deep fire zone, brought the nickel off the edge and the safety dropped down, ya know?

00:00:17.416 --> 00:00:18.833
- Word, Imma use that in Madden.

00:00:18.833 --> 00:00:19.666
[Doorbell ringing]

00:00:19.666 --> 00:00:21.250
- That must be Whitworth with the brie!

00:00:21.833 --> 00:00:23.291
- Cincy here to win the natty.

00:00:23.291 --> 00:00:25.708
- HOLY F--KING S--T! THE COOL KIDS! AYO, COME THROUGH!

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:31.125
- Was anyone expecting the Bengals?

00:00:31.125 --> 00:00:33.500
- Uh-oh. I heard they bring the house down.

00:00:33.916 --> 00:00:36.041
- IT’S GETTING PRETTY LATE. TIME TO TURN IN?

00:00:36.041 --> 00:00:38.125
- COOL. WE’RE GONNA KEEP GOING.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:39.708
- We just won’t let them go off—

00:00:39.708 --> 00:00:40.625
[Thumping]

00:00:40.625 --> 00:00:43.125
- Yo, my bad. The bookshelf was talking s--t.

00:00:43.791 --> 00:00:46.250
- ♪♪♪ IT’S THE J-O-SINGLE-E. BURROW! ♪♪♪

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:47.375
- Oh, sup, LeBron?!

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:49.000
-  YO, BURROW! EM!

00:00:49.375 --> 00:00:51.666
I’VE NEVER BEEN TO A PARTY WITH TWO CHILL WHITE DUDES.

00:00:51.666 --> 00:00:55.416
♪♪♪

00:00:55.416 --> 00:00:57.416
- UH, BEEN A RIDE OR DIE SINCE WEEK 10.

00:00:57.416 --> 00:00:59.916
- I’m beginning to feel like I’m a YAC god, YAC god.

00:00:59.916 --> 00:01:03.291
- I’m Leonardo DiCaprio, and I do NOT care what sport this is.

00:01:03.291 --> 00:01:06.000
- Aight, hear me out: You replace Brodie.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.875
♪♪♪

00:01:08.875 --> 00:01:10.291
- I got Zac Stacks, y'all!

00:01:10.291 --> 00:01:11.625
- Please be careful. Please—

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.583
I DID NOT LEAVE DETROIT FOR THIS.

00:01:13.583 --> 00:01:15.541
- REMEMBER: DETROIT NEVER LEAVES YOU.

00:01:15.541 --> 00:01:16.750
- Yes, Mr. Mathers.

00:01:17.791 --> 00:01:19.916
- Man, I wish Gridiron Heights taught me about saving money.

00:01:19.916 --> 00:01:21.708
- We got surprisingly great rates at State Farm.

00:01:21.833 --> 00:01:22.875
- This show IS perfect!

00:01:25.666 --> 00:01:26.916
- So I don’t even use protection.

00:01:26.916 --> 00:01:28.541
- ALL RIGHT, ENOUGH. THREE AND OUT YOU GO.

00:01:28.833 --> 00:01:32.208
- Sorry, guy, I kind of just do whatever the f--k I goddamn please.

00:01:32.541 --> 00:01:35.541
- That worry on your face? That’s McFEAR, SON!

00:01:36.458 --> 00:01:38.791
- [Cheering together:] LET’S GO, GUY FROM BENGALS DEFENSE!

00:01:39.541 --> 00:01:42.333
- DO NOT TEST ME. I WILL GO DOWN IN FLAMES.

00:01:43.166 --> 00:01:44.541
- THIS IS OUR HOUSE.

00:01:44.916 --> 00:01:46.291
Well, we share it, but still.

00:01:46.458 --> 00:01:47.166
- Are we all in?

00:01:47.416 --> 00:01:48.916
- YES. F--K THEM PICKS!

00:01:50.041 --> 00:01:51.583
- Hey, look, my keys still work!

00:01:52.291 --> 00:01:54.250
[Alarm sounding]

00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:55.875
- Damn, he’s gotten good at the silent count.

00:01:57.791 --> 00:01:59.041
- Not much of a Chase.

00:01:59.125 --> 00:02:01.041
- Man, you’re just trash...talking.

00:02:01.041 --> 00:02:01.541
- [Grunting]

00:02:05.208 --> 00:02:08.958
- ♪♪♪ Stop all this football drama in this dancery. ♪♪♪

00:02:09.291 --> 00:02:13.458
- Looks like some sort of football fight broke out at a well-produced
hip-hop dancery.

00:02:13.708 --> 00:02:16.041
- No matter what happens, hell of a party.

00:02:16.041 --> 00:02:16.791
- [Coughing]

00:02:16.791 --> 00:02:17.458
- Are you choking?

00:02:17.458 --> 00:02:18.875
- I don't do that anymore.

00:02:21.625 --> 00:02:23.083
- Is that...Zac? 

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:24.625
How the hell you'd get here?

00:02:24.833 --> 00:02:26.875
- WHAT?! HUH. JUST A LIL ZAC NAP!

00:02:26.875 --> 00:02:29.666
SO WHAT I LET LOOSE AND HAD FUN?
YOU’RE NOT MY DAD ANYMORE!

00:02:30.333 --> 00:02:31.791
- Zac, you’re two years older than me.

